Description: Bluetooth proximity detector for automatic screen lock/unlock
 KBlueProximity locks and unlocks your desktop based on the proximity of a
 Bluetooth device (typically a mobile phone). This Qt6 edition targets
 Plasma 6 / Wayland via loginctl and the freedesktop ScreenSaver D-Bus
 interface, with a system tray StatusNotifierItem.
